WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.375 --> 00:00:03.425
Unit one. Exercise and Play!

2
00:00:04.375 --> 00:00:08.011
Hello, everyone! I'm Nurse Bopha, your school nurse.

3
00:00:08.061 --> 00:00:11.749
Hi, Nurse Bopha! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:11.800 --> 00:00:15.702
Today we learn about Exercise and Play. Let's go!

5
00:00:16.593 --> 00:00:19.660
Run. Say it with me. Run!

6
00:00:23.162 --> 00:00:26.262
Jump. Say it with me. Jump!

7
00:00:29.757 --> 00:00:33.140
Play. Say it with me. Play!

8
00:00:36.647 --> 00:00:40.597
Exercise. Say it with me. Exercise!

9
00:00:44.078 --> 00:00:47.578
Strong. Say it with me. Strong!

10
00:00:51.095 --> 00:00:54.712
Energy. Say it with me. Energy!

11
00:00:58.219 --> 00:01:02.102
Outside. Say it with me. Outside!

12
00:01:05.586 --> 00:01:08.886
Fun. Say it with me. Fun!

13
00:01:12.389 --> 00:01:19.914
I like to run and jump when I play outside. Exercise gives me energy and makes my body strong. Playing with friends is always fun.

14
00:01:19.964 --> 00:01:21.128
I can do that too!

15
00:01:22.454 --> 00:01:27.841
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:27.891 --> 00:01:29.041
Play!

17
00:01:29.817 --> 00:01:34.876
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:34.926 --> 00:01:36.076
Outside!

19
00:01:37.081 --> 00:01:43.485
Did you know? Children should get at least 60 minutes of exercise every day to stay healthy!

20
00:01:43.535 --> 00:01:45.500
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:01:46.179 --> 00:01:54.176
Think and answer. What is your favorite way to exercise or play?

22
00:01:54.226 --> 00:01:55.376
Great answer!

23
00:01:56.547 --> 00:02:01.538
Great job today! Stay healthy, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:02:01.588 --> 00:02:04.376
Goodbye, everyone! Stay healthy!

